scription": "Research-Creation Project: The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables the rapid creation of prototypes, offering a playful and participatory way to shape architectural concepts. The Polyblocs tool provides practitioners with a space for freedom and agency often lacking in conventional architectural design solutions, fostering spontaneous expression in the previsualization process.\n\n", "short_description": "The Polyblocs construction game, integrated into a virtual environment, enables rapid prototyping, offering a playful, participatory approach to architectural design while fostering freedom and spontaneity in previsualization.\n\n\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "cov1.png", "id": "2351174138582301", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974759_2351174141915634_2969451169120856586_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XoWG3Pu_1DYQ7kNvwHOWliv&_nc_oc=AdpXYWnLiwvEcU0kOP6OEtbMANTBPW43sl2ZKI0CN37QNDAC9m7IU2nrrNaTl8c4WiY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2mI3qOQuuR26C9aE4Y0ITLUHZj81ijqplP8uNNcOjXuA&oe=69F0BC09"}, {"file_name": "cov4.png", "id": "1531289950891358", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485579_1531289954224691_4417623240716955788_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wa-fx_qF24kQ7kNvwEYy2a5&_nc_oc=Adq2ysmR-hPCcfw83bQ_dRI9aRBIBxcqhwA_k2zzf6vHgop2VppzqvtUM1UVQJgW-qY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0hZS7Yjvzvr5R2JEgUi0w3ejzyEr-H03Z6fStsP_m43w&oe=69F0BA3D"}, {"file_name": "banner pb 1440 1440 v2.png", "id": "1498865307473211", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031361_1498865310806544_8225324080290249197_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJ7PiYmhazUQ7kNvwEQjC25&_nc_oc=AdrWylL6xVmIOqJ6EEFov1Bf5Us1LC3fXeAPQLrdjKnCpjmphktuf9TAwzBxK0r3